You draw thermal energy from your surroundings to replenish your Psi.

This will freeze all targets within radius [1, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] for [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5; PSI 50%)] (max [2, 3, 4, 4, 4 (TL1-5)]) turns, and deal [77, 104, 125, 142, 158 (TL1-5; MP 100; PSI 50%)] (max [116, 156, 187, 214, 237 (TL1-5; MP 100)]) Cold damage.

You replenish [10, 13, 15, 18, 20 (TL1-5; PSI 50%)] (max [15, 20, 23, 27, 30 (TL1-5)]) Psi from the first target, with each additional target restoring 20% less than the one before it.

The damage and the strength of these effects increases as your Psi depletes and with your Mindpower.
